{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>阿爾巴尼亞及意大利同樣爆發示威，其中阿爾巴尼亞發生警民衝突。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.EU.PROTEST 0330 untill 23 Nov 2359_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QMmsHfphf51792878006.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>阿爾巴尼亞首都地拉那爆發反政府示威，有放在警方防線前的，垃圾桶起火。有示威者拆走路磚，並掟向警員及建築物。警方水炮車射水驅散示威者，警員手持盾牌在車後推進。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.EU.PROTEST 0330 untill 23 Nov 2359_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026msPNRluNhv1792878016.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>至於在意大利首都羅馬，有數百名極右學生上街，回應一周前米蘭等地示威演變為騷亂一事。他們指示威是神聖的權利，不代表有權毀壞店舖，不滿有人宣稱代表學生，但騎劫真正的訴求並大肆破壞。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.EU.PROTEST 0330 untill 23 Nov 2359_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026AviHWndsew1792878013.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>在北部都靈市，防暴警察跟示威者爆發衝突，互相推撞。有防暴警察更被圍困，示威者向防暴警察投擲雜物，防暴警察要後撤。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.EU.PROTEST 0330 untill 23 Nov 2359_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026cIGWYESDbt1792878011.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T22:40:24.319642+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":255,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T21:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T02:18:02.087560+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T22:38:07.658251+00:00","content_hash":"8bcf7e7e349120d1d396339dba3483a06d36c7045dad30d5eb6d3549983e7335","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T22:40:24.319642+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}